# Production build env — committed, PUBLIC values only: everything VITE_* is
# compiled into the browser JS. Never put a secret here (Telegram, proxy
# secret, Upstash stay server-side — see .env.example).
#
# The inquiry endpoint: the REG.RU relay (deploy/regru-api/) → Vercel
# /api/lead → Telegram. Yandex Object Storage has no runtime env, so it is
# baked in at build time. A host that serves its own /api/lead (Vercel) can
# override it with VITE_LEAD_API_URL=/api/lead in that host's build env.
VITE_LEAD_API_URL=https://api.era-cosmetology.ru/lead/
